static bool ParseAbiTags(State *state) {
  State copy = *state;
  DisableAppend(state);
  if (OneOrMore(ParseAbiTag, state)) {
    RestoreAppend(state, copy.append);
    return true;
  }
  *state = copy;
  return false;
}
```

`OneOrMore(ParseAbiTag, state)` → `ParseAbiTag`:
```cpp
static bool ParseAbiTag(State *state) {
  return ParseOneCharToken(state, 'B') && ParseSourceName(state);
}
```

`ParseOneCharToken(state, 'B')` reads `mangled_cur[0]`. If `mangled_cur` moved backward to before the buffer start, this reads before the buffer → underflow.

